Verdict:
  glm-decode-b1   : speedup= 0.97x -> BREAK-EVEN -> megakernel must win via threadgroup inter
  glm-decode-b4   : speedup= 1.05x -> BREAK-EVEN -> megakernel must win via threadgroup inter
  glm-prefill-512 : speedup= 1.20x -> FUSED WINS -> native-vs-separated Δ>=10% met on projection floor
  glm-prefill-2048: speedup= 1.31x -> FUSED WINS -> native-vs-separated Δ>=10% met on projection floor
  llama-prefill-512: speedup= 0.99x -> BREAK-EVEN -> megakernel must win via threadgroup inter
  llama-prefill-2048: speedup= 1.28x -> FUSED WINS -> native-vs-separated Δ>=10% met on projection floor

Summary: 3/6 regimes meet Δ>=10% on projection floor.
